msgstr "Configurazione"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The configured SmokePing file is read with the files it includes, from its own directory. An uploaded file is read on its own: @include is not allowed in it."
msgstr "Il file SmokePing configurato viene letto insieme ai file inclusi, dalla propria directory. Un file caricato viene letto singolarmente: @include non è consentito al suo interno."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
#, php-format
